  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Drain and rinse red lentils. <br>• Cut zucchini into thin quarters. <br>• Trim Fioretto. Halve any thicker stalks of <br>Fioretto lengthways. <br>• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).<br>• Place zucchini on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with <br>olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast <br>until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-e1d9e000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large <br>frying pan over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook ginger paste, mild North Indian spice <br>blend, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste, <br>stirring until fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Add the water, coconut milk and stock <br>concentrate, stirring to combine. Add lentils<br>and bring to the boil.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, cover with a lid and <br>cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are <br>softened, 20-22 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-26d96f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When zucchini has 15 minutes remaining, move <br>zucchini to one side of the oven tray and add <br>Fioretto to the other side. <br>• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss <br>to coat. Roast until tender, 10-15 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-06b14720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice mini flourtortillas (see ingredients) into <br>3cm strips.<br>• Place tortilla strips in a single layer on a second <br>lined oven tray, drizzle or brush with olive oil<br>and season with salt and pepper.<br>• Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-bdd51030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Once lentils have softened, stir roasted zucchini<br>and baby spinach leaves through dhal. Season <br>to taste.<br>TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the dhal, if <br>needed. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-eeded240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide lentil dhal between bowls. Top with <br>roasted Fioretto, Greek-style yoghurt and chilli.<br>• Serve with tortilla dippers. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84ee64264524ca9792ee3/step-c6607e50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
